                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Every page in Angy is backed by exactly one Y.Doc. The document lives in Redis while it is being edited, is persisted to S3 on a debounce, and is never stored as a binary blob in Postgres.",
