                  "fill": "$text-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When an editor clicks Edit, the client opens a WebSocket to Hocuspocus and hydrates from the live document. Readers never take this path — they are served pre-rendered HTML.",
